CONTRACT DEFINITION:
1. RESEARCH NOTE: See plan/012_7dd502f7feb9/architecture/implementation-status.md §F1.F. generateCommitMessage(diff) at src/utils/git-commit.ts:~290 currently calls createCommitMessageAgent() with no args and buildCommitMessageUserPrompt(diff) for the user prompt. It is wrapped by a retry() loop inside smartCommit. The git-log call (getRecentCommitMessages) inside the retry boundary is acceptable: git log is a fast local operation, not a transient API call.
2. INPUT: getPrpCommitStyle() and getPrpCommitStyleExamples() from P1.M1.T1.S1; getRecentCommitMessages() from P1.M1.T2.S1; buildCommitMessageSystemPrompt() from P1.M1.T3.S1; createCommitMessageAgent(systemPrompt?) from P1.M1.T3.S2.
3. LOGIC: Modify generateCommitMessage(diff) in src/utils/git-commit.ts. Before creating the agent (the existing const agent = createCommitMessageAgent() line), add style resolution:
   - const style = getPrpCommitStyle();
   - let resolvedStyle: PrpCommitStyle = style;
   - let examples: string[] | undefined;
   - if (style === 'auto') { const n = getPrpCommitStyleExamples(); if (n > 0) { examples = await getRecentCommitMessages(n); } if (!examples || examples.length <= 1) { resolvedStyle = 'plain'; } }
   - const system = buildCommitMessageSystemPrompt(resolvedStyle, examples);
   - const agent = createCommitMessageAgent(system);
   The rest of the function (createPrompt, agent.prompt call, error handling for empty/error/sentinel output) is UNCHANGED.
   Add imports at the top of git-commit.ts: getPrpCommitStyle, getPrpCommitStyleExamples from '../config/constants.js'; getRecentCommitMessages from '../tools/git-mcp.js'; buildCommitMessageSystemPrompt from '../agents/commit-message-agent.js'; PrpCommitStyle type import from '../config/constants.js'.
4. OUTPUT: generateCommitMessage now produces style-aware descriptive commit messages. formatCommitMessage still layers the position prefix afterward (UNCHANGED). The retry wrapper, fallback placeholder (buildFallbackCommitMessage), and Smart Commit Resilience are all unaffected.
5. DOCS: [Mode A] Update the JSDoc on generateCommitMessage to document the style resolution flow (auto/plain/conventional/gitmoji, example injection for auto, degradation to plain for ≤1-commit repos, EXAMPLES=0 disabling). Do NOT create a separate docs subtask.
